BT /F1 16 Tf 50 740 Td (Alpine Peak 2 Tent - Setup Manual) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 50 700 Td (Cairn Outdoor Co. - Gear that finds your way.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 50 682 Td () Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 50 664 Td (1. Unroll the tent body on level ground, doors facing your preferred direction.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 50 646 Td (2. Assemble the two color-coded aluminum poles by connecting the shock-corded sections.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 50 628 Td (3. Feed each pole through its matching sleeve, starting from the labeled end.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 50 610 Td (4. Insert pole tips into the four corner grommets, then arch the poles to raise the tent.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 50 592 Td (5. Clip the tent body to the poles along each clip strip, working corner to corner.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 50 574 Td (6. Stake out the four corners, then the vestibule guy-lines, keeping the fabric taut.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 50 556 Td (7. Attach the rainfly, matching the color-coded corners, and clip it to the pole frame.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 50 538 Td (8. Tension the rainfly guy-lines last so the fly does not touch the tent body.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 50 520 Td () Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 50 502 Td (Setup time: approximately 8-10 minutes for two people.) Tj ET
endstream
